%%% note
負の Duration の hours・minutes・secs は、それぞれの単位の剰余で符号を保つ
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
[|PT-1H-30M-15S|, |PT-26H-5S|, |PT-59S|, |P-1DT-2H|] map {
  hours: $.hours, minutes: $.minutes, secs: $.secs, seconds: $.seconds, days: $.days
}
%%% output application/json
[
